  "hindi": "जिसमें, यज्ञ के नेता में, सात लगामें फैली हुई हैं। मनु के समान दिव्य आठवाँ पोता उस सब को प्रेरित करता है।",
  "english": "In whom, the leader of the sacrifice, seven reins are stretched. Like Manu, the Potṛ priest sets all that in motion, the divine eighth.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "raśmi is taken as 'rein' (alternatively 'ray'). The accusatives daivyam aṣṭamam stand beside the nominative potā; the construction is unclear and is rendered as a loose apposition. manuṣvat could also be 'as in the time of Manu'. The antecedent of yasmin is not named in the verse.",
