  "hindi": "क्योंकि उज्ज्वल के साथ उज्ज्वल प्रशास्ता संकल्प से उत्पन्न हुआ है। जानने वाला उसके दृढ़ व्रतों के साथ-साथ शाखा की भाँति ऊपर चढ़ता है।",
  "english": "For together with the bright one the bright Praśāstṛ priest has been born, by resolve. Knowing his firm ordinances, he climbs along them like a branch.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "praśāstṛ is rendered 'director' (it may name the Praśāstṛ priest). kratu is rendered 'power' (alternatively 'resolve, skill'). In the second line vayā is taken as a nominative singular 'branch'; the subject of rohate is vidvān; asya is Agni, understood from the hymn.",
